q 0 g BT 31.19 605.03 Td (1.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 605.03 Td (\(1 point\) Find all employees who have a job as salesman.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 590.86 Td (A\) select all salesman from emp;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 576.69 Td (B\) select empno, ename from emp where job = 'salesman';) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 562.51 Td (C\) select Count\(*\) from salesman;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 548.34 Td (D\) select Count\(*\) from emp where job = 'salesman';
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 519.99 Td (2.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 519.99 Td (\(1 point\) Find all managers who make more than 2000 dollars) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 505.82 Td (A\) select ename from emp where job = 'MANAGER' or sal > 2000;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 491.65 Td (B\) select manager from emp where sal > 2000;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 477.47 Td (C\) select ename from emp where job = 'MANAGER' and sal > 2000;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 463.30 Td (D\) select ename from emp where job = MANAGER and sal > 2000;
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 434.95 Td (3.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 434.95 Td (\(1 point\) What can the statement "select constraint_name from user_constraints where table_name =) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 420.78 Td ('ACCOUNTS'" do?) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 406.61 Td (A\) find all the primary keys on Account table) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 392.43 Td (B\) find all the foreign keys on Account table) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 378.26 Td (C\) find all domain validation rules on Account table) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 364.09 Td (D\) All of the above
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 335.74 Td (4.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 335.74 Td (\(1 point\) Find those employees whose name starts with letter K) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 321.57 Td (A\) select * from emp where ename like '*K*';) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 307.39 Td (B\) select * from emp where ename like '%K%';) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 293.22 Td (C\) select * from emp where ename like 'K*';) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 279.05 Td (D\) select * from emp where ename like 'K%';
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 250.70 Td (5.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 250.70 Td (\(1 point\) Find the department located in BOSTON in the following table: DEPT\(DEPTNO, DNAME, LOC\)) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 236.53 Td (A\) select department from DEPT where loc= BOSTON;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 222.35 Td (B\) select deptno from DEPT where location = 'BOSTON';) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 208.18 Td (C\) select dname from dept where loc=BOSTON;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 194.01 Td (D\) select * from DEPT where loc='BOSTON';
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 165.66 Td (6.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 165.66 Td (\(1 point\) Finds all salesmen who are making less than 1500 dollars) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 151.49 Td (A\) select salesman from emp where sal < 1500;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 137.32 Td (B\) select * from emp where sal < 1500;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 123.14 Td (C\) select ename from salesman where sal < 1500;) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 108.97 Td (D\) select ename from emp where job = 'SALESMAN' and sal < 1500;
) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 31.19 80.62 Td (7.) Tj ET Q
q 0 g BT 59.53 80.62 Td (\(1 point\) Find the number of employees in each department) Tj ET Q
